      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'Your eyes feel like they were sown together. It actually takes some
          strength to get them to open...


          You feel crusty salt falling
          onto your mouth.


          You were probably out for quite a while.'
        type: 0
        typeString: 
